"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3563960","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1846651706691273","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"update","title":"Next Fest is live - Demo Update 0.3.1","summary":"Steam Next Fest has started!The demo has been for some time now and Next Fest is finally here, so we've made a little update! What's new:A brand new space backgroundThe Void now shows a little warning... if you know where to lookMerchants have a new animation of flying in and out of the stationEnergy rebalance for a smooth startCat Day is now real 🐱A lot of fixes and polishingFull version will come Q1 2027If you haven't tried our demo yet, this week is the perfect time. If you enjoy it, wishlist","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:57:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691273","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1844751498235301","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo version","summary":"Hi architects!We’ve prepared a major update for Astro Architect, introducing new systems, reworking existing mechanics, improving UX and game balance, and adding many new ways to manage your station.This version will be available as the Demo during the Steam Next Fest on 19-26th October.We invite you to jump into the new demo and give it a try!🏢 Factions, Management & Employee ProgressionFaction system and faction management board, which affects votingFaction tasks and needsTechnology tree based","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T19:44:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1810503566588160","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"announcement","title":"Second Demo Available Now!","summary":"Hi architects! DemoWe have just released the second demo version of the game. You can play it now! Feedback All your feedback will be appreciated and will have impact on how the final game looks and plays. There's a special section in Steam Community Hub for telling us what you think, but feel free to create your own threads there. There's also dedicated in game function to leave us feedback or report any bugs. Your Frost Crown Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-16T18:56:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566588160","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1802893906871508","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"announcement","title":"Work status and Discord","summary":"Hi architects!Work statusWe haven't written in a while, but that doesn't mean we're not working on the game. We have just finished all the core mechanics and are starting to work on content for the third and fourth tiers of employees.Here you have all tiers quarters. Worker -> Technician -> Engineers -> Scientist (WIP name)Discord ServerIn addition, we finally created a discord where we are going to share the progress of the work asking for your feedback. If you want to be part of the developmen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-23T22:28:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802893906871508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1795283637789164","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix Patch 0.0.12","summary":"Hi architects! We fixed a bug which blocked playing the game after opening the Expedition Map. Sorry for that :c Your Frost Crown Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-26T14:53:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795283637789164","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1794830911004182","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Available Now!","summary":"Hi architects! As we previously announced, we are pleased to announce that demo version of Astro Architect is available to be played right now! https://store.steampowered.com/app/3563960/Astro_Architect_Demo/ While the game downloads, check out the first trailer. Feedback All your feedback will be appreciated and will have impact on how the final game looks and plays. There's a special section in Steam Community Hub for telling us what you think, but feel free to create your own threads there. T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-24T16:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830911004182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3291440-1794830910910055","game_id":"steam-3291440","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release Date","summary":"Hi architects! Two weeks ago we had the pleasure to announce our game. We are excited to announce that we will release the demo version of Astro Architect during the Steam City Builder and Colony Sim Fest on March 24th. Your Frost Crown Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-21T16:59:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830910910055","verified_